It seems like you want to find an average, grouping by categorial variables Location, Meter, Texture, and Time? If so tidyverse is the way to go, e.g.:

> library(tidyverse)
> library(readxl)
> d <- read_xlsx('/Users/vinceb/Downloads/example\ data\ for\ stats\ help.xlsx')
> d %>% group_by(Location, Meter, Texture, Time) %>% summarize(N2O_mean=mean(N2O))
