You may use subset fuction without loading any library like
dataSet = read.csv(----)
dataN2O.1 = subset(dataSet,  Location == 1 && Meter ==1 && Texture == 'sa')
dataN2O.2 = subset(dataSet,  Location == 1 && Meter ==1 && Texture == ' SaLo')
dataN2O.avg = (dataN2O.1 $N2O + dataN2O.2$N2O)/2

I think this may solve the problem if I understand what you are seeking for.

Cheers.
ML

